# Platform: mobilesite
# Story: GJDT-22417 — 360° icon on every 360° image in the details page Photos section (AC1, AC5, AC6 grid)
# Tags: smoke, b2b, pdp, 360, GJDT-22417
# Params : prot3_pdp_360

open ${prot3_pdp_360}
wait for page to load
wait until element pdp_tab_photos is visible
click pdp_tab_photos
wait until element pdp_photos_heading is visible
verify element pdp_photos_heading is visible
verify element pdp_photo_360_icon is visible
store count of pdp_photo_tile as photo_tiles
store count of pdp_photo_360_icon as icons_360
verify element pdp_photo_360_icon is inside every pdp_photo_tile_image
verify element pdp_photo_360_icon is at the same place in every pdp_photo_tile_image
store position of pdp_photo_360_icon in pdp_photo_tile_image as grid_icon_position
take screenshot as photos_section_icons
